# Bot2 destroys the Bringer with Infernal Grasp while its enters trigger is on the stack. The trigger still resolves (the
# source's presence is not needed, CR 113.7a) and "if you cast it" was checked as it triggered: each player's other
# creatures are sacrificed (Bot1's Ornithopter, Bot2's Elvish Mystic), and then every creature card that was not put into
# a graveyard that way returns - the Llanowar Elves Entomb put there, and the Bringer itself, which was put there by the
# Grasp, not "this way". Returned, it was not cast, so it triggers nothing more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Bringer of the Last Gift
Ornithopter
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Entomb
Infernal Grasp
Elvish Mystic
Mox Jet
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island x11

